# Test Fixtures Directory
# Place test audio files here for audio processing tests
#
# Recommended test files:
# - test_crying_baby.wav - Sample of baby crying for detection tests
# - test_ambient_noise.wav - Background noise for negative tests
# - test_car_engine.wav - Car engine sound for filtering tests
# - test_music.wav - Music sample for false positive prevention
#
# Audio Format Requirements:
# - Sample Rate: 44100 Hz
# - Channels: Mono (1 channel)
# - Bit Depth: 16-bit or 32-bit float
# - Format: WAV (uncompressed)
# - Duration: 2-5 seconds per file
